--   **Window bound.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegJCost1`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.Side.win_le (hs : 0 < s) (hst : s ≤ t) (hl : 1 ≤ lam) (w x X : ℕ) :
--       s * ((LJ s t lam w).toFinset.filter (fun j => x ≤ j ∧ j ≤ x + X)).card ≤
--         2 * w * (s * ((X + 2 * w) / lam + 3) + (t - s) * (X + 2 * w + 1) + s)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** J cost 1: windows of the near-boundary list
--
--   * `LJ_cover`: every `j ∈ LJ` is within `w` of a cut `< s` or of `s`;
--   * `bad_Ico`: `s · #{l ∈ [a, a+Y) : ¬ stepOK l} < (t - s) Y + s`;
--   * `mult_Ico`: `#{c ∈ [a, a+Y) : λ ∣ c} ≤ Y/λ + 2`;
--   * **`win_le`**: `#{j ∈ LJ : x ≤ j ≤ x + X} ≤ 2w ((X+2w)/λ + 4 + (t-s)(X+2w+1)/s)`.
